  "openQuestions": [
    "Fallback cash receipts are 결제정보.현금 of 수납 rows only; prepaid cash top-ups (선수금현금충전) are not included, unlike the server 현금흐름 (desk.md says the fallback includes them — it does not).",
    "Fallback cash refunds count 환불 only on rows whose 결제정보 has exactly one key '현금'; refunds on mixed-method rows are ignored.",
    "When 현금흐름 is present the server's 예상마감금액 is used even if it disagrees with its own components; the client never recomputes it.",
    "is재정산필요 compares 마감금액 with the expected amount by strict inequality; it is computed but its consumer was not traced.",
    "시작금액 0 counts as registered (정산전); only null is 미등록."
  ]
